  "description": "Run Bun, the fast all-in-one JavaScript runtime and bundler, as a .NET tool: `dotnet bun install`, `dotnet bun run build.mjs`. Platform-specific packages embed the matching Bun binary, so `dotnet tool restore` works offline and pins Bun through .config/dotnet-tools.json - no download, no network, hash-verified by NuGet. Every argument is forwarded to Bun verbatim.",
